<h1>Mount Kit Terms of Sale</h1>
  <p class="updated">Effective date: 4 August 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Last updated: 24 August 2026</p>

  <p>These terms apply when you buy the <strong>Clippar Mount Kit</strong> — the phone mount, the Bluetooth clicker and the portable charger. They're separate from our <a href="/pages/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a>, which cover the app, because buying a physical product and subscribing to software work differently under Australian law and deserve to be written differently.</p>

  <div class="notice">
    <h3>Who you're buying from</h3>
    <p>Clippar Pty Ltd<br>
    ACN 701 393 277 &middot; ABN 69 701 393 277<br>
    53 Franklin Street, Kelvin Grove QLD 4059, Australia<br>
    Brisbane, Queensland, Australia<br>
    Contact: <a href="/pages/contact">contact form</a> or <a href="mailto:support@clippargolf.com">support@clippargolf.com</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="toc">
